---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About Us | Neovantis"
  description="Neovantis is a South African-led medical company dedicated to improving lives through clinically trusted innovation, serving South Africa and neighbouring African countries across specialist medical disciplines."
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/images/neoventis-about-hero.png');"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-content">
        <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-accent);margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Who We Are</p>
        <h1>About Us</h1>
        <div class="accent-bar" style="margin-left:auto;"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Neovantis Promise -->
  <section class="section section--lg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2" style="align-items:center;gap:4rem;">
        <div>
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-accent);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">The Neovantis Promise</p>
          <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Improving Lives Through<br/>Clinically Trusted Innovation</h2>
          <span class="accent-bar"></span>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">At Neovantis, we are committed to improving lives through clinically trusted innovation. We work to support healthcare professionals with specialised medical solutions that combine precision, reliability, and practical clinical value.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Our approach is built on genuine partnerships with clinicians, hospitals, and healthcare organisations — providing not just products, but the support, knowledge, and service that enable excellent clinical outcomes.</p>
          <p>Every solution we provide reflects our commitment to physician confidence, patient outcomes, and long-term value in clinical practice.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(31,127,182,0.3);">
          <img src="/images/neovantis-clinton-visagie.png" alt="Neovantis — clinically trusted innovation" style="width:100%;height:420px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center 20%;display:block;" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About Our Company -->
  <section class="section section--sm" style="background:var(--bg-secondary);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>About Our Company</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
        <p>Neovantis is a South African-led medical company serving South Africa and neighbouring African countries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2" style="gap:3rem;align-items:start;">
        <div>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Our focus is on delivering high-quality, professionally supported solutions across orthopaedics, pain management, urology, neuro plating, and related healthcare disciplines. We are driven by a commitment to physician confidence, patient outcomes, and long-term value in clinical practice.</p>
          <p>We work directly with orthopaedic surgeons, pain management specialists, neurosurgeons, urologists, hospitals, surgical centres, and medical distributors — providing solutions that meet the highest clinical and regulatory standards.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Our team brings together deep medical device expertise and a genuine commitment to improving patient outcomes. We understand the pressures of modern healthcare environments and are positioned to deliver responsive, knowledgeable support to every partner and client.</p>
          <p>Founded on the principles of honesty, integrity, passion, and innovation — these values are not simply words. They guide every product decision, every partnership, and every interaction we have across the healthcare community.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Market Presence -->
  <section class="angled-panel">
    <div class="geo-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
      <div class="grid-2" style="align-items:center;gap:4rem;">
        <div>
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-accent);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Market Presence</p>
          <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem;">South African-Led.<br/>Regionally Focused.</h2>
          <span class="accent-bar"></span>
          <p style="margin-bottom:1.5rem;">With a growing footprint across South Africa and a vision for broader African reach, Neovantis is positioned to support healthcare providers, hospitals, specialists, and clinical partners with dependable medical solutions and responsive service.</p>
          <p style="margin-bottom:2rem;">Operating out of Durban, our local presence means responsive technical support, reliable delivery, and clinical teams that understand the demands of the South African healthcare environment.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Contact Us</a>
            <a href="/distributors" class="btn btn-primary" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">Partner With Us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(31,127,182,0.3);">
          <img src="/images/neovantis-healthcare-professionals.png" alt="Neovantis healthcare professionals across South Africa" style="width:100%;height:380px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;display:block;" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Vision & Mission -->
  <section class="section section--lg">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="grid-2" style="gap:3rem;">
        <div class="card" style="padding:2.5rem;">
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:0.25em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-accent);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Our Vision</p>
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Shaping the Future<br/>of Healthcare</h3>
          <div style="width:40px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue-dark),var(--blue-accent));margin-bottom:1.25rem;border-radius:2px;"></div>
          <p>To help shape the future of healthcare through innovation, excellence, and solutions that improve patient care and support better clinical outcomes across South Africa and the broader African region.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card" style="padding:2.5rem;">
          <p style="font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:0.25em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--blue-accent);margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Our Mission</p>
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Empowering Healthcare<br/>Professionals</h3>
          <div style="width:40px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue-dark),var(--blue-accent));margin-bottom:1.25rem;border-radius:2px;"></div>
          <p>To provide trusted medical solutions that empower healthcare professionals with the tools, support, and confidence they need to deliver effective, high-quality patient care in specialist clinical environments.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Core Values -->
  <section class="section section--sm" style="background:var(--bg-secondary);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Our Core Values</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
        <p>Five principles that guide everything we do — from solution selection to clinical partnerships and professional service.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-4" style="gap:1.5rem;">
        {[
          { title: 'Innovation', sub: 'creativity is our strength', desc: 'We continuously seek out and evaluate clinically relevant technologies that can make a meaningful difference to healthcare outcomes.' },
          { title: 'Collaboration', sub: 'better together', desc: 'We build genuine partnerships with healthcare professionals, distributors, and partners who share our commitment to clinical excellence.' },
          { title: 'Integrity', sub: 'trust built through action', desc: 'Every product we supply and every commitment we make is backed by unwavering integrity and professional accountability.' },
          { title: 'Excellence', sub: 'in everything we do', desc: 'From solution quality to professional support, we hold ourselves to the highest standards across every part of our business.' },
        ].map(v => (
          <div class="value-item card" style="text-align:center;">
            <h3 style="color:var(--blue-accent);font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">{v.title}</h3>
            <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-style:italic;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">{v.sub}</p>
            <div style="width:40px;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue-dark),var(--blue-accent));margin:0 auto 0.75rem;"></div>
            <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">{v.desc}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="text-align:center;max-width:500px;margin:1.5rem auto 0;">
        <h3 style="color:var(--blue-accent);font-size:1.5rem;margin-bottom:0.25rem;">Patient-Centricity</h3>
        <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-style:italic;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">at the heart of everything</p>
        <div style="width:40px;height:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue-dark),var(--blue-accent));margin:0 auto 0.75rem;"></div>
        <p style="font-size:0.9rem;">The patient is at the centre of every solution we provide. We measure our success by the outcomes we help deliver to patients and the professionals who care for them.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;">
      <h2>Work With Neovantis</h2>
      <p>Explore our solution portfolio or get in touch to discuss how Neovantis can support your clinical, procurement, or distribution requirements.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="/solutions" class="btn btn-outline">View Solutions</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.15);border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">Get in Touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</MainLayout>
